#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:1
msgid "Overview of the vector library docker."
msgstr "Pregled zloženega okna vektorske knjižnice."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:10
#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:15
msgid "Vector Library"
msgstr "Vektorska knjižnica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:10
msgid "SVG Symbols"
msgstr "Simboli SVG"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:10
msgid "Reusable Vector Shapes"
msgstr "Vektorski liki, ki jih je mogoče ponovno uporabiti"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Vector Library Docker loads the symbol libraries in SVG files, when "
"those SVG files are put into the ``symbols`` folder in the resource folder :"
"menuselection:`Settings --> Manage Resources... --> Open Resource Folder`. "
"They are a type of :ref:`resource <resource_management>`."
msgstr ""
"Zloženo okno Vektorska knjižnica naloži knjižnice simbolov v SVG-datoteke, "
"ko so te SVG-datoteke v mapi ``symbols`` v mapi z viri :menuselection:"
"`Nastavitve --> Upravljaj vire … --> Odpri mapo virov`. So vrsta :ref:`vira "
"<resource_management>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:21
msgid ""
"The vector symbols can then be dragged and dropped onto the canvas, allowing "
"you to quickly use complicated images."
msgstr ""
"Vektorske simbole lahko nato povlečete in spustite na platno, kar vam "
"omogoča hitro uporabo zapletenih slik."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:23
msgid ""
"Currently, you cannot make symbol libraries with Krita yet, but you can make "
"them by hand, as well as use Inkscape to make them. Thankfully, there's "
"quite a few svg symbol libraries out there already!"
msgstr ""
"Trenutno še ne morete narediti knjižnic simbolov s Krito, lahko pa jih "
"naredite ročno, kot tudi uporabite Inkscape, da jih naredite. Na srečo je "
"tam že kar nekaj knjižnic simbolov SVG!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/vector_library.rst:27
msgid ""
"`SVG symbol element explain at Mozilla Developer Network <https://developer."
"mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/symbol>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Element simbola SVG je pojasnjen v Mozilla Developer Network <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/symbol>`_"
